    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Enhance your WooCommerce product cards with custom information elements that provide additional details, promotional messages, or unique selling points.</p>\n<p>Add text blocks, icons highlight special offers, shipping details, or exclusive product features.</p>\n<p>The benefits of using Product Property</p>\n<p>The plugin provides two options for creating additional content that will be placed on the card.<br />\n1. Meta box that is placed on the product creation page.<br />\n2. The plugin creates a separate section in the main WooCommerce menu<br />\nIn it you can create all our information elements and set them by bulk.</p>\n<p>Our information elements are:<br />\n– Lists of properties for the product, which are displayed on the product card<br />\n– Additional information elements for the product card</p>\n<p>The main function of the plugin is to help you customize your product card to suit your marketing needs.</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<p>– Creating your own product property elements to be placed on the product card.<br />\n– Creating your own information elements to be placed on the product card.<br />\n– Bulk manager.<br />\n– Library of information elements.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://edubin.web-dev.stream/sample-page/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Live Demo</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://develux.com/documentation-for-plugins/product-properties-description/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Documentation</a></p>\n<p>For all technical questions, please contact us by email plugins_support@develux.com or visit our website develux.com where you can get help setting up the plugin.</p>\n<h3>General instructions for using the plugin</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fkebJcbTMdU?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>General settings for Product Properties</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-RJkUxO23XU?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>How to use Product Card Properties</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fkebJcbTMdU?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Creating and configuring information elements in the product Meta Box</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/u__NeTHTfqw?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Working with a library of information elements</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1jDcH_j9Wvk?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Working with a Bulk manager for information elements</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aNhmzBTWi2U?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Where can I get support?</h3>\n<p>For support, please email to<br />\nplugins_support@develux.com<br />\nor visit our technical documentation page:<br />\nhttps://develux.com/documentation-for-plugins/product-properties-description/</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Download and install Product Properties plugin using the built-in WordPress plugin installer.</p>\n<p>If you download Product Properties plugin manually, make sure it is uploaded to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code><br />\nand activate the plugin through the <code>Plugins</code> menu in WordPress.<br />\nOr follow the steps below:<br />\nPlugins &gt; Add new &gt; Upload plugin &gt; Upload product-card-properties.zip &gt; Install Now &gt; Activate Plugin.</p>\n",
        "faq": "<p>For support, please email to<br />\nplugins_support@develux.com<br />\nor visit our technical documentation page:<br />\nhttps://develux.com/documentation-for-plugins/product-properties-description/</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<p>1.0.3<br />\n* Minor updates related to new versions of WordPress and PHP</p>\n<p>1.0.2<br />\n* Tested on the latest versions of WordPress and WooCommerce</p>\n<p>1.0.1<br />\n* Created pagination for the library with information elements<br />\n* Added additional information about the plugin in the admin panel</p>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date – 25 May 2025</em></p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Product properties plugin for marketing things",
